// output tokens, tools called) and every build records per-stage wall time and usage in
// build.json `usage`; mechanical compile errors are fixed without a model turn (autofix.js);
// fresh builds get only Read/Write/Edit; optional knobs MB_EFFORT, MB_CACHE_TTL, MB_DEDUPE.
